# SPECIFICATION-DERIVED, not captured: no iOS lane has ever run this scanner, so
# there is no `log show` corpus to mine yet and every line below is written from
# the two renderings the tool documents. The first iOS lane's upload is the
# corpus source, exactly as CI run 34766632019 was for Android, and until then
# the rc-3 "no line parsed as `ios` framing" net is what turns a THIRD rendering
# into a red lane instead of a quiet pass.
#
# One line per column variant of each rendering. The process is always `Runner`
# on a Haven-owned line: `frb_user` is the os_log SUBSYSTEM and `HavenSLC` /
# `HavenBGTask` are NSLog message prefixes, so both belong in the message, not in
# the process column. The coordinate is synthetic and is not a declared needle;
# the only declared value here is the pubkey on the last line, which sits on an
# UN-OWNED line on purpose.
